          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tCHESHAM ROAD TL 00 SW\t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        \t 6/4                                    \t\tEast and South Barns -                                      \t\tat Whelpley Ash Farm GV                                     \t\tII 2 barns adjoining at right angles.  Mid C17 S barn, later C17 E barn. Timber frames on brick sills, dark weatherboarding with steep red tile roofs.  Older S barn of 6 bays with gabled projecting S porch off-centre to W.  Jowled posts with long straight braces to tie-beams.  Inclined queen-posts support a clasped-purlin in each slope with principal not diminished above notch to house purlin. Collar truss in porch. E barn has  3  narrow bays  at  N with  jowled  posts with  curved  inclined queen-posts in roof and housings for former axial floor beams between the tie-beams. Mortices in posts for a floor structure. A lower floor has been inserted. Bays to S end have unjowled posts. N bay next road largely rebuilt in C19. Listing NGR: TL0040503341"
    }
  ],
